    "$comment": "Night Owl palette for gen-primer-theme. Source: https://github.com/sdras/night-owl-vscode-theme themes/Night Owl-color-theme.json (MIT) — editor.background #011627, editorWidget.background #021320, input.background #0b253a, focusBorder #122d42, badge/panel.border #5f7e97, editorLineNumber #4b6479, editor.foreground #d6deeb, comment #637777, blue #82aaff, green #addb67 (strings/tags; terminal green #22da6e), red #ef5350 (errors) / #ff5874, orange #f78c6c, yellow #ecc48d / #ffcb8b, purple #c792ea, cyan #7fdbca, teal #80cbc4. Base: @primer/primitives dark. Canvas editor bg, inset widget bg, raised input bg, borders focusBorder / badge, text editor fg; the comment grey is 3.9:1 and badge grey 4.3:1, so muted is a derived #829ab0 and badge grey is disabled. Accent + primary button + link blue (dark text), success green, danger red (fg #ff5874 for text), attention yellow #ecc48d, severe orange, done + sponsors purple (the single purple).",
